From: GallopLin <1317864235@qq.com>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 06:12:45 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 6/7] feat(bench): async DCP baseline (PCCHECK_BACKEND=dcp) in
 the same trainer with the same 3N state

torch.distributed.checkpoint.async_save + FileSystemWriter(sync_files=True),
bounded in-flight saves (DCP_MAX_ASYNC), rotating slot dirs, optional cached
pinned staging (DCP_CACHE_STAGED, default on), DCP_THREAD_COUNT; profile
events aligned with CascadeSnap (stage_ms, durability_latency_ms).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
